WEBVTT

00:11:57.008 --> 00:12:00.362
and reflect the kind of world
that we want to live in.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.363
In November of 2016,

00:12:03.387 --> 00:12:06.170
Krista Suh, Jayna Zweiman and Kat Coyle

00:12:06.194 --> 00:12:11.365
created a hat to be worn
at the Women's March in Washington, DC.

00:12:11.389 --> 00:12:13.590
(Applause)

00:12:14.653 --> 00:12:18.109
This was the day after
the presidential inauguration.

00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:22.739
Two months later,
on January 21, 2017,

00:12:22.763 --> 00:12:28.884
millions of people all over the world
wore handmade pink pussyhats

00:12:28.908 --> 00:12:31.999
in support of the Women's March
all over the world.